# All values below are optional tuning knobs — no API keys are required.
# Fahsai's REST API and Nominatim are both public/unauthenticated.
#
# The Fahsai API's base URL is not configurable here — it's a fixed implementation
# detail (src/fahsai-client/client.ts), not a per-install preference.

# Place-resolver (Nominatim) cache TTL, in seconds.
# PLACE_RESOLVER_CACHE_TTL_SECONDS=86400

# Default radius (km) used to convert a resolved place to a bounding box.
# DEFAULT_GEOCODE_RADIUS_KM=55
